WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.160
I'm sorry for calling you out so late.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.700
It's about the incident.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.820
Did you figure something out?

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:10.080
Please look at this list of missing people.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.330
Sakagami Sakura.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:20.210
The Sakagami household has produced a master samurai called Sakagami Tesshuu in year 12 of the Genroku period.

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:21.550
Toudou Keiko.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:26.220
The Toudou household has produced the master samurai Toudou Samon in year 7 of the Meiwa period.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:30.220
On the next page, the Oguri household did so in year 2 of the Bunsei period.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:36.940
The victims of the Spirited Away Incident are all descendants of famous households that have produced master samurai...

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.310
Is that what you mean?

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:40.440
It doesn't seem like a coincidence to me.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:42.320
What's Onii-sama trying to do?

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.860
We can't single out Yoshihiko-sama as the culprit yet.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.950
It's not the time to be hesitant any more.

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:51.700
You know that the Tokugawa household has a villa in South Bouso, right?

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:52.290
Yes.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:57.960
All documents with "official" on them are stored in the independent server there.

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:03.630
If we access it, we might get a clue as to what Onii-sama is doing.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:04.550
Underground Server Room

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:10.720
But, Onii-sama will eventually hear that I accessed the data.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.730
It'll be seen as openly picking a fight with Yoshihiko-sama...

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:15.440
So? Are you scared?

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:21.480
Okay?

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.530
It's okay.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:30.160
Shh, can't you carry it more quietly?

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:30.990
Whoopsies.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:35.160
It's an incident that might have adverse effects on the pillar that is the shogunate!

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.500
I can't say what would happen if Yukimura or Jyuubei heard of it.

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:40.790
Do you understand the gravity of the situation?

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:45.510
I know, but why do we need so much baggage just to stay one night?

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:47.130
I need a lot.

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:50.680
A change of clothes, cosmetics, a towel, snacks, a swimsuit, a beach ball, and a banana boat.

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:53.260
We're not going there to play.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:54.390
You know that, right?

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:56.390
I-I know.

00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:59.400
Let's at least split the load in half...

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:03.570
What is this?

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:04.230
An alarm?

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:06.190
Muneakira, stop it already.

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:07.650
R-Right.

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:12.910
Where are you going at this hour?

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:13.740
Damn!

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:15.240
Fool!

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:18.410
Did you think we'd let you do anything you want?

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:19.290
Yukimura!

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:21.040
You stealing cat!

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.290
Where are you planning on taking Muneakira?

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:25.710
We'll make you confess.

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:27.050
Come on!

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:27.920
Spill it!

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:31.760
Muneakira! Do something!

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:33.390
Muneakira-san!

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.100
What are these bags?

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:36.220
Um...

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:39.890
Onii-chan, what are you doing so late?

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:42.360
Ohii-sama, you drugged me, didn't you!

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:44.400
Damn, I messed up the dosage.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.480
Even to your allies?

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:46.610
That's horrible...

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:50.030
Where are you heading without letting us know?

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:52.280
Onii-chan, were you guys going somewhere?

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.700
Well, "going" in a way...

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:56.580
Where were you going?

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:57.870
'Fess up already!

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.210
Senhime-sama!

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.080
Where were you...

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.000
Going to?

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:06.800
T-To...

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.380
A little vacation...

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:47.520
So, Senhime-sama and some guests will be showing up.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:52.490
It <i>is</i> somewhat sudden, but we will welcome them completely prepared.

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:54.490
Are you all ready?

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:55.360
Yes!

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:57.660
This is a perfect disguise!

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.910
Not a single one of them will notice I'm an outsid-

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.330
Hey, you there.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.750
Outsiders are prohibited from these premises.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.250
No, I'm just new here.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.290
It's not like I'm a suspicious individual who put on a disguise and snuck in here-

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:11.250
Then stop smiling and listen to me!

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.840
Yes ma'am...

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:16.720
Five hours later...

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:19.430
Onii-chan, let's play together!

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:23.470
Yeah, I'll play once everyone's here.

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:25.180
No way!

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:28.860
Let's play in the sand together!

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:33.360
It doesn't seem like I can act until nightfall.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.610
Ohii-sama, that's just too mean.

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:37.780
You were even going to leave me, Hanzou?

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:40.160
You got to come here, so stop complaining!

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:43.830
If you keep this up, I'll drug you next time so you never wake up again.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:48.960
Besides, you've done nothing but screw up lately. Totally useless.

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:53.840
B-Beautiful!

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:57.380
She perfectly coordinated the leading fashions!

00:05:58.340 --> 00:05:59.840
And a wild Mukeakira appears!

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:02.680
It seems as though he's taken notice of us.

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:06.270
Muneakira-san can't take his eyes off of your beauty, Ohii-sama.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:08.900
He's in a total state of excitement!

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:10.810
Of course he is!

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:11.730
Right?

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:14.900
Here you go, Yukimura-san.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.820
Your swimsuit matches you well.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:25.040
It seems like even the genius strategist couldn't find a way to cover that infantile form.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:27.540
Look at it any way you want, it's still a total victory for me!

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:29.960
Th-There's some trouble, Ohii-sama.

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:30.750
What?

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:34.630
Muneakira's line of sight is locked on Yukimura-san!

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:37.510
His heart rate and body temperature are both rising further!

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:41.930
Darn it, I didn't know Muneakira had such specialized fetishes...

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:43.470
Fools.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.680
Tokugawa Sen, you've lost!

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:48.310
Wh-What did you say?

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:51.520
Your swimsuit is indeed full of the leading fashions.

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:53.650
However,

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:59.990
the beings we know as men are total dimwits who have no idea what the leading fashions among girls are!

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:00.910
In other words,

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:01.570
Bad Taste

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:04.240
when comparing a blonde aristocrat wearing brand-name items,
Bad Taste

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:04.450
Bad Taste

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:05.370
Pure

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:08.080
and a pure, black-haired girl with a white one-piece on...
Pure

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:11.830
The things that men want have nothing to do with fashion!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:16.880
Girliness that doesn't change with the times; <i>that</i> is what's best.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.420
To put it another way...

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:20.930
School swimsuits are the best!

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:25.810
I won't forgive you!

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:26.010
They're fighting again.

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:27.060
If you can't even figure <i>that</i> out, you fail as a princess!

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:29.560
It seems like Senhime-san's really mad.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:30.060
Lately, my heart races and I feel dizzy when I see them around.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:32.980
You might as well go back and change!

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:33.400
Lately, my heart races and I feel dizzy when I see them around.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.020
Are you okay, Onii-chan?

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:35.980
Time to duel!

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.480
Bring it on!

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:39.030
Graceful Elegance!

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:40.490
No Regret of Corporeal Life!

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:46.740
Stop!

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:48.160
Calm down, both of you!

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.160
Besides, why are you two fighting?!

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:52.040
Because of you, obviously!

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.630
Who else?!

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:58.920
Yukimura-sama has already told you her true feelings, Muneakira-san.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:01.550
The same goes for Ohii-sama.

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:04.300
How long are you planning to stall this?

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.220
Make up your mind already!

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:08.470
It better not be that flat-chest!

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:11.020
What did you say, you yammering bitch?!

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.100
Wait a moment!

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:16.270
That's not something I can decide so easily, is it?

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:18.440
Is there a problem with that?

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:20.480
Be a man and make up your mind already!

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:22.900
It's not that easy to decide on marriage...

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:24.490
Marriage
It's not that easy to decide on marriage...

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:24.910
Mar-

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:25.320
riage?!

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:29.830
Since I kissed them, the only responsibility I can take as a man is to marry them.

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:33.870
Then I have to go talk to your parents and whatnot...

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:35.460
In that case...!

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.210
Let's all marry together, the four of us!

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:38.590
Like that's possible!

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:41.090
Then the six of us can marry together!

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:44.800
I can't forgive this!

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:48.100
He might as well be impregnating everything he touches!

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:51.100
What a savage! Muneakira the Beast!

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:54.600
Oh, I said something good right there.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:54.940
Yagyuu

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:55.350
With Yagyuu...
Yagyuu

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:56.100
With Yagyuu...

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.480
Beast
and beast...

00:08:58.020 --> 00:08:59.900
Muneakira the Beast!

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:02.990
That's funn-

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:06.780
Shoot, it was so funny that I almost forgot to continue spying.

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:08.910
Crap, they disappeared.

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:11.830
To escape from my perfect surveillance...

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:14.540
Muneakira the Beast is a force to be reckoned with.

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:17.170
<b>Tokugawa
Selfless
Service</b>

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:19.670
I'm sorry, Yoshihiko-sama.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:20.340
<b>Tokugawa
Selfless
Service</b>

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:21.340
Two Days Ago...
Two Days Ago...

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:26.760
Yoshihiko-sama generously forgave me of my epic failure.

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:27.890
What's more, he...

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:30.470
Kanetsugu, it's just as you say.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:33.810
Everything is Yagyuu Muneakira's fault, for he uses love to his advantage.

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:34.930
Yes sir.

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:38.060
Is it all right if I ask you to finish him off?

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:39.230
I'd be glad to!

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:45.530
Thank you. If things get tough, you can use the present I gave you earlier.

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:46.530
All right.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.780
Yoshihiko-sama, please watch!

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:55.410
I, Naoe Kanetsugu, will certainly stop Yagyuu Muneakira's breath-

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:56.790
Hey, newbie.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:10:00.630
You've got some guts to be slacking off on your first day.

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:03.210
No!

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:07.470
St-Stop, please! I have an important task to do!

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:10.510
Relax, we have a mountain of tasks to do.

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:14.930
No way! At least let me take my hammer!

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.390
Seven o'clock...

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:19.730
Tokugawa Household's Villa

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:22.060
Underground Server Room

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:26.690
<i>Seven o'clock</i>

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:26.740
<i>Zero
Seven o'clock</i>

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:26.900
Five minutes

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:27.860
"Tokugawa Sen"

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:30.740
Now there's no turning back.

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:35.120
Tokugawa Yoshihiko

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.080
Unable to be searched

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.710
So it <i>is</i> impossible...

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:40.670
The shadow covering Great Japan

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:41.630
You may be accessing the restricted system.
Access is denied with the current user privilege settings.
Attention

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:46.050
The only ones who can access the server are people close to the shogunate.

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:49.510
There's a document that even insiders can't be shown?

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:51.890
How can I get past this security?

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:56.270
It might be possible for her.

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:57.180
Sanada Yukimura

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:59.730
But I can't drag her into this.

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:04.320
Outrageous!

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:08.240
Was that Tokugawa Sen eating high-quality food like this every day?

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:10.070
Outrageous, outrageous!

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:12.070
Yukimura-sama, you should take a bath soon.

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:13.160
Indeed.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:15.280
All right, it's bath time.

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:15.780
Yes ma'am.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:16.790
Yeah!

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:18.830
Whoa, wait Matabei!

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:20.290
Beta-san, wait up!

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:23.040
You guys will regret it if you go in before me!

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.040
She's late...

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:25.540
She's too late...

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:27.630
The wind probably feels really good at night.

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:30.260
Ohii-sama really said she wanted to take a walk alone?

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:32.760
Yeah, she said so.

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:34.640
Unusual sweating.

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:37.850
Your body temperature and blood pressure both show signs of emotion.

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:39.430
Th-That's strange.

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:43.310
I guess I'll take a bath too, though it's a little early.

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:45.360
Wait, Muneakira-san!

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:47.730
Strange...

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:48.730
Men

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:53.490
But man, why do I have to do all this?

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:56.990
Right there!

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:04.460
Perfect!

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:08.500
As expected of me! I can even be a maid!

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:13.630
A person coming into the men's bath?

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:19.970
Wow, even the bath here is big.

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:24.560
It's Yagyuu Muneakira. What great timing!

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:28.570
B-But there's no way I could win without my beloved hammer.

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:33.530
A-And I don't think I can keep this position up much longer.

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:34.950
At this rate...

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:41.040
You fiendish sex maniac! I-I'll punish you with the power of love!

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:44.830
But I'll give you a lot of <i>my</i> love before that.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.250
Take this!

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:49.420
No, don't!

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:52.800
No, it's slippery, stop!

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:54.970
How's my love?

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:56.640
Take this!

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:59.220
No, st-stop!

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:00.310
Stop!

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:06.020
What should I do?!

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:07.650
The temperature's perfect.

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:09.400
Wh-When did he...?

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:13.530
This isn't good, I'm at my limit-

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:28.750
A scream?

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:29.290
Could it be...

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:30.290
Yukimura-sama!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.420
This voice...

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.420
Kanetsugu?

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:37.380
Yagyuu Muneakira, on Yoshihiko-sama's orders, I'll punish you!

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:38.090
What?!

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:42.350
Y-Y-You pervert!

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:45.060
Who's the pervert?! This is the men's bath!

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:47.810
Pervert, pervert, pervert!

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:48.520
You are...!
Pervert, pervert, pervert!

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:48.850
You are...!

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:51.480
Stop right there!

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:53.820
It <i>was</i> Kanetsugu.

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:55.530
Yukimura-sama, this way!

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:57.860
Wait!

00:13:59.740 --> 00:14:00.620
Muneakira?

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:01.580
Senhime-sama!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.290
What was that scream?

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:03.990
It's Kanetsugu.

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:06.620
She was an assassin sent by Yoshihiko-sama.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.090
You can't run now!

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:13.090
Surrender already!

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:14.960
What are you doing all of a sudden?!

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:17.260
You're at fault for running away.

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:21.180
If you committed no crime, you'd have no reason to run.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:21.970
Hurry up and...

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:22.970
Confess already!

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:26.390
Wh-What should I do?

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:29.350
Yoshihiko-sama!

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:33.150
Are you connected to Tokugawa Yoshihiko?

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:35.400
Why are you saying Yoshihiko-sama's name?

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:39.450
Th-This is the end...

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:41.990
Yoshihiko-sama!

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:45.080
Please give me strength!

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:55.670
Could this be...?

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:03.010
This is the ultimate weapon I received from Yoshihiko-sama, The Familiar of Love!

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:08.390
Now, Familiar of Love, punish those fools!

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:11.810
Hey wait, why me?

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:14.270
Those are the fools!

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:16.900
Whoa, she got eaten!

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:19.990
That means she was the fool.

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:21.490
Is she all right?

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:23.620
It appears to be acting odd.

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:26.870
Is that familiar an evil being?

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:30.160
Shoot, Kanetsugu is going to be taken in.

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:32.880
Was Kanetsugu a pawn from the start?

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:37.090
Stay back, it's not something you guys can deal with.

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:37.880
Yes ma'am.

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:51.600
I didn't think it would have this much power...!

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:53.350
Yukimura-sama!

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:57.770
Senhime-sama!

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:01.030
Are you all right, Yukimura?

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:02.070
Muneakira!

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:03.990
What <i>is</i> that thing?

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:05.990
An instigation by Tokugawa Yoshihiko.

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:09.040
Kanetsugu was tricked and taken into it.

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:10.950
We have to save her!

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:12.660
Onii-sama...

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:14.830
I'll do it.

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:16.290
You two stay back!

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:17.250
Senhime-sama!

00:16:26.850 --> 00:16:28.260
Imperial Spark!

00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:28.560
Imperial Spark
Imperial Spark!

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:29.720
Imperial Spark

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:37.560
Stop it!

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:43.110
Wh-What are you doing, flat-chested forehead bitch?

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:45.780
Idiot, are you planning to kill Kanetsugu with it?!

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:49.080
I measured it carefully. I just have to beat that monster, right?

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:51.500
That's why I'm calling you an idiot!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.830
They've already merged bodies.

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:57.170
If the familiar dies, so will Kanetsugu.

00:16:57.170 --> 00:16:59.130
Then what are we supposed to do?!

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:00.920
W-Well...

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:03.670
See, you don't have a plan either.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:05.340
You puny fake strategist.

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:08.260
What did you say?! You perverted selfish princess!

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:09.560
What?!

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:09.890
You're not the only master samurai anymore.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.390
They're fighting again.

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:12.060
You're not the only master samurai anymore.

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:12.890
I'm getting dizzy again...

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:13.350
You idiot!

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:14.890
Are you all right, Onii-chan?

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:18.400
Seems like I have to settle a score with <i>you</i> first.

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:20.320
Bring it on!

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:22.570
Ohii-sama!

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:24.740
Yukimura-sama!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.150
Ohii-sama! Get down!

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:29.990
Matabei!

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:30.870
Hanzou!

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:35.710
Matabei!

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:36.710
Hanzou!

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.130
Matabei!

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:39.080
Hanzou!

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:40.420
Matabei!

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:42.130
Don't stand in front of me!

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:44.720
Shut up, yammering bitch!

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.340
Even in this situation...

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:48.680
You two keep on fighting?

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:51.680
Yukimura, Senhime-sama.

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:55.020
Will you two cut it out already?!

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:00.520
Both of you, do you understand what's happening?!

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:04.940
To rescue you two, Hanzou-san and Matabei-san were captured!

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:10.320
Just because it's Kanetsugu with a weak-looking familiar doesn't mean you can underestimate them!

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:22.670
Onii-chan, are you okay?!

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:23.340
Yeah.

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:26.840
Yukimura! Figure out a way to defeat that thing, now!

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:27.840
Affirmative!

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:30.050
Senhime-sama, provide backup while she does that!

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:31.180
Leave it to me!

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:34.100
What should we do, Yukimura?

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:38.390
Just defeating it is easy, but the issue is that Kanetsugu melded with it.

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:42.860
The core of the familiar, its weak point, is stuck to Kanetsugu's chest.

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:49.400
Going through all of those tentacles and hitting the weak spot without any error is a difficult task.

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:52.490
On top of that, the target is moving.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:54.990
Even with a master samurai's power-

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:55.830
It's possible!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.620
Jyuubei can do it.

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:02.210
Indeed, it may be possible for <i>that</i> Yagyuu Jyuubei.

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:03.380
Muneakira.

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:11.430
You called out Yagyuu Jyuubei?

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:16.100
You sure seem to call me out in the crappiest of times.

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:18.480
Kanetsugu's inside the familiar.

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:19.640
I know that.

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:21.730
You'll do it, right?

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:22.560
Impossible.

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:25.440
Alone, that is.

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:35.830
You sure took a while!

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:38.620
I was just giving you a chance to show off!

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:42.830
Jyuubei, are you ready?

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:44.540
I must concentrate.

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:46.500
I'll leave the timing to you.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.300
Yukimura, Senhime-sama,

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.930
get rid of all the tentacles in the way!

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:54.300
Are you ready?

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:55.720
Yes, whenever.

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:03.100
Twirling Ascension!

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.650
Twirling Ascension
Twirling Ascension
Twirling Ascension!

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:05.150
Twirling Ascension
Twirling Ascension

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:11.990
Blasting Flash!

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:13.660
Flash
Blasting
Flash
Blasting
Blasting Flash!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.830
Jyuubei, now!

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:29.050
Got it!

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:49.440
Is Kanetsugu all right?

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:51.860
No worries, she's just unconscious.

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:53.990
I see. Good.

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:56.110
Thank you.

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:59.740
I didn't do it by myself.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:00.370
Yeah.

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:05.290
Without Senhime-sama and Yukimura's cooperation, we wouldn't have beaten it.

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:11.050
Hey, Muneakira. It seems like some interesting samurai are gathering around you.

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:17.090
No matter how things may become, I have a feeling that with everyone cooperating, we can overcome it.

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:19.970
Don't you think so, Senhime-sama?

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:26.310
You're right.

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:28.650
I have something to tell you guys.

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:30.610
Will you listen?

00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:12.670
Everyone, how are you doing?

00:23:12.670 --> 00:23:16.250
The samurai of love and justice, Naoe Kanetsugu has arrived.

00:23:16.250 --> 00:23:21.220
Kanetsugu, you're pretty amazing to get into the Tokugawa household's villa despite such heavy security.

00:23:21.220 --> 00:23:23.970
It's nothing for a talented individual such as myself.

00:23:23.970 --> 00:23:25.350
How did you do it?

00:23:25.350 --> 00:23:31.060
I read an informative brochure, then had an interview, went through a month of training, and was officially employed!

00:23:31.060 --> 00:23:33.020
That's just a part-time job, isn't it...?

00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:34.690
Next time, Hyakka Ryouran:

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:36.440
The Shadow Covering Great Japan

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:39.530
You'll get to see me in action!
